<title>USA: Watts extends 500,000 share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Watts extends 500,000 share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH ANDOVER, Mass. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watts Industries Inc said Wednesday its board of directors had authorized the company to repurchase up to an additional 500,000 shares of its class A common stock through the open market and private purchases during the next twelve months.</p>
<p>The company had previously repurchased 2,680,200 shares from 3,000,000 authorized in April and July of last year. The balance available for repurchase from those two authorizations is 319,800 shares, which will be completed before the current authorization commences, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company estimated its outstanding shares at about 27.0 million.</p>
<p>Watts Industries designs, manufactures and sells valves for plumbing and heating, water quality, industrial, steam, and oil and gas markets.</p>
</text>
